\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The thing my God doth hate
\par That I no more may do,
\par Thy creature, Lord, again creat,
\par And all my soul renew.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My soul shall then, like Thine,
\par Abhor the thing unclean,
\par And, sanctified by love divine,
\par For ever cease from sin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. That blessed Lord of Thine,
\par Jesus, to me impart;
\par The Spirit's law of life divine,
\par O write it in my heart!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Implant it deep within,
\par Whence it may ne'er remove,
\par The law of liberty from sin,
\par The perfect law of love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thy nature be my law,
\par Thy spotless sanctity,
\par And sweetly every moment draw
\par My happy soul to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Soul of my soul remain!
\par Who didst for all fulfil,
\par In me, O Lord, fulfil again
\par Thy heavenly Father's will!
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

